<p><strong>Technical documentation templates for the IT organization.</strong></p>
<p>Pick a template below, create a child page from it, and fill in the bracketed placeholders. Every template shares the same layout: a summary band, a sidebar with page properties, and a collapsed note explaining how to use it.</p>
