<h2>How to choose</h2>
<table>
<tbody>
<tr><th>You need to…</th><th>Use</th></tr>
<tr><td>Explain what a service is and who owns it</td><td><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title="Service Overview"/></ac:link></td></tr>
<tr><td>Describe how a system is built</td><td><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title="Architecture Overview"/></ac:link></td></tr>
<tr><td>Record a decision and why</td><td><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title="ADR-000: Architecture Decision Record"/></ac:link></td></tr>
<tr><td>Propose a change before building it</td><td><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title="Design Document"/></ac:link></td></tr>
<tr><td>Tell someone how to handle an alert or routine task</td><td><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title="Runbook"/></ac:link></td></tr>
<tr><td>Define a controlled process with approvals and audit trail</td><td><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title="Standard Operating Procedure"/></ac:link></td></tr>
<tr><td>Help people diagnose a problem by symptom</td><td><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title="Troubleshooting Guide"/></ac:link></td></tr>
<tr><td>Write up an incident after it is resolved</td><td><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title="Incident Postmortem"/></ac:link></td></tr>
<tr><td>Document an API, its auth, and its errors</td><td><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title="API Reference"/></ac:link></td></tr>
<tr><td>List every setting a component accepts</td><td><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title="Configuration Reference"/></ac:link></td></tr>
<tr><td>Announce a version</td><td><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title="Release Notes"/></ac:link></td></tr>
<tr><td>Walk a newcomer to a first working result</td><td><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title="Getting Started"/></ac:link></td></tr>
<tr><td>Give a recipe for one task</td><td><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title="How-to Guide"/></ac:link></td></tr>
<tr><td>Bring a new team member up to speed</td><td><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title="Onboarding Checklist"/></ac:link></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h2>Conventions</h2>
<ul><li>Every page starts with a one-sentence summary in the header band. It is an excerpt, so other pages can pull it in.</li><li>Page properties hold Owner, Status, and Last reviewed. The report below reads them, so keep the labels as they are.</li><li>Status lozenges: 
<ac:structured-macro ac:name="status"><ac:parameter ac:name="colour">Grey</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name="title">DRAFT</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro>
<ac:structured-macro ac:name="status"><ac:parameter ac:name="colour">Yellow</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name="title">IN REVIEW</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro>
<ac:structured-macro ac:name="status"><ac:parameter ac:name="colour">Green</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name="title">APPROVED</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro>
<ac:structured-macro ac:name="status"><ac:parameter ac:name="colour">Red</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name="title">DEPRECATED</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro>
</li><li>Bracketed italic text is a placeholder. A page is not done until none are left.</li></ul>
<h2>All templates</h2>
